It contains no third-party source code. At run time it can use, without bundling them:
  OpenCV (Apache-2.0), NumPy (BSD-3-Clause), pandas (BSD-3-Clause), PyYAML (MIT), Matplotlib (Matplotlib License),
  and optionally PyTorch (BSD-3-Clause), Kornia (Apache-2.0) and LightGlue with its DISK and SIFT weights (Apache-2.0).

